        },
        {
          "text": "I kare mo Paulo owaco ki Barnaba ni, “Bin wek wadok ka limo utmego ma i gaŋ ducu ma yam watuco iye lok pa Rwot, wanen kit ma gitye kwede.” ",
          "type": "text",
